  "notes": "{揉|も}む means to rub, massage, or work with the hands.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ⟦{肩|かた}→肩：02192_kata⟧を{揉|も}む\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{肩|かた}→肩：02192_kata⟧を{揉|も}む: to massage shoulders\n- {揉|も}み⟦{消|け}す→消す：00528_kesu⟧: to hush up (a scandal)\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧を{揉|も}む: to wring one's hands (in anxiety)\n- ⟦{揉|も}め{事|ごと}→揉め事：08361_momegoto⟧: trouble, dispute\n\nPASSIVE/CAUSATIVE:\n- {揉|も}まれる: to be kneaded, to gain experience through hardship\n- ⟦{世間|せけん}→世間：03299_seken⟧に{揉|も}まれる: to be tempered by the world",
